	(text "ROUTING - DOTSTARS\nU7 -> D3 CLK/DATA short and routed together, over GND.\nLED-to-LED CO->CI and DO->DI as matched pairs.\nC40-C44 at each LED VDD pin. C51 where +5V enters the chain.\nLEDs in the 5-dot shell pattern."
		(at 199.39 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
				(color 255 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c089af8c-c54b-4930-8722-8dbe584c13c8")
	)
	(text "DOTSTAR LEVEL SHIFT\nU7 SN74AHCT125 on +5V, 3.3V in -> 5V out, tpd 6-10ns.\nBB-2020BGR-TRB VIH = 0.7 x VDD = 3.5V, so a shifter is needed.\nLED SPI (SPI2, TX only) = 3 Mbit/s in V0.3:\n   bit = 333ns, tpd = 3% of a bit. LED max clock under 10MHz.\nMust be AHCT: VIH 2.0V (TTL). AHC needs 3.5V.\nUsed: 1A p2 -> 1Y p3 CKI, 2A p5 -> 2Y p6 SDI, 1OE/2OE p1/p4 = GND.\nSpare gates 3/4: inputs p9/p12 = GND, OE p10/p13 = +5V (off),\noutputs p8/p11 open.\n!! Default KiCad APA102-2020 footprint does NOT fit this LED -\n   make one from the BB-2020BGR-TRB land pattern.\n\nDECOUPLING\n   C45 100nF at U7.\n   C40-C44 100nF, one per LED (D3-D7).\n   C51 22uF bulk (5 LEDs at full white ~300mA)."
		(at 297.18 252.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a94281a-3f35-470c-b1c8-0ac9981b87b2")
	)
	(hierarchical_label "LED_SPI_MOSI"
		(shape input)
		(at 71.12 157.48 180)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "856cb781-c562-46db-8542-ef1a0f112db6")
	)
	(hierarchical_label "LED_SPI_SCK"
		(shape input)
		(at 71.12 180.34 180)
		(effects
